# ItamiBen schedule — the first five columns are standard crontab fields.
# <min> <hour> <dom> <mon> <dow>  <reminder text>  [!command]
# See AGENT.md for the rules.

# Example: an hourly nudge. Off by default — delete the leading # to turn it on.
# 0 * * * *   Nice work. Keep it up.

# Example: put the machine to sleep at 23:00, and say why.
# The name after ! refers to commands.json.
# 0 23 * * *   Time to sleep !sleep
